{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Clear MDC when the owner-thread scope closes.** `onInvocationStart` writes to the handler worker\u2019s thread-local MDC, but invocation-end now runs on the caller thread, so its clear affects another thread. These scopes restore only OTel context, leaving trace metadata on pooled workers. Wrap both branches so close also clears/restores MDC, mirror the fix in `ExecutionOtelPlugin`, and add an MDC-enabled reused-worker test for success and suspension.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74rLNZ","finding_digest":"f770d9316915760cf8290d83cad6dc45284b21811110b564c2fdb4b8d425772d","finding_id":"arf_v1_65ynsmljcv3az6bjbwb4vvw4iu","finding_key":"otel-plugin/invocationotelplugin::activatehandlercontext::mdc-owner-thread-cleanup","identity_key":"otel-plugin/invocationotelplugin::activatehandlercontext::mdc-owner-thread-cleanup","line":363,"observation_digest":"f83ad202ca5ee2d917456b2f6273f1f9afebf6e59f59cd064ad4f0530db3dc3d","observation_id":"aro_v1_7a5neawkl3rnsf2fnmxwe47r7g","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/InvocationOtelPlugin.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T06:52:51Z","review_id":"arr_v1_nnq557wot6h6dzssirniq6wdt3","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"a4cc6d2e9a7a6880e8bf73b87c9c3b10fcba5715","reviewer":"codex","start_line":362,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_efkot6kflyocdzhms5wqvfkj73","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T06:52:51Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
